#2460
The Air Gets Cold~
It is no longer getting cold, it IS cold.  The air has dropped down
near freezing, the steady breeze that blows through the caves making
it seem all the more cold.  The floor continues to slope downward to
the east, the darkness as complete as darkness can be.  Any sounds
made in this dark, lonely place echo back a thousand fold - making the
isolation complete.
~
